  "selection": "Only fit20: require zero known foreign links, maximize known correct links, tie smaller age cap then simpler forward-only. If no eligible configuration select B0. Known labels use actual sparse anchors; unknowns are never negatives. Only after sealing selection read evaluate26 labels.",
  "controls": "No FlyVis, retinal image, optical flow or neural computation. BBOX is the ordinary geometry baseline for any future matched signal addition. B0 must be byte-exact with disabled policy; all enabled physical boxes/confidence/classes equal B0. BIDIR changes only a backward ordinary-motion veto after the identical forward singleton test; it never creates a singleton by discarding a competitor.",
  "strongest_alternative": "More exposed links may simply merge foreign fragments. A successful conditional result is only a cheap gate and cannot establish full tracking benefit.",
  "gate": "Selected has >0 correct fit links, zero known foreign links on fit and historical26, and positive lower95% paired-video bootstrap delta(correct−foreign) on26. Full20 remains forbidden on failure. Family12 corrected intervals reported; no fresh independent test is claimed.",
